WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.368
-Please, please.
-[ British accent ] Please sit.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.770
-Please. I know, please.
-Sit, please.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.138
-No, you sit. You sit, as well.
-Sit.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.573
You have to sit first.
-Yeah, I know.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.574
-It's -- It's polite.
-I love your accent.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:09.943
-Oh, thank you.
I love yours.

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.277
-Oh, really? Well...
-Yeah.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.778
-[ British accent ] It's
just that -- I just grew up in,

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:14.280
um...
-Yeah.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.282
-What -- What part of London
is this voice?

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.017
-[ South London accent ]
It's probably like South London.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.785
-Oh, wow!
You can do South London?

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:20.987
-South London.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.521
-But how do you make it
sound cute, even...

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:24.023
-[ Normal voice ]
I don't think I do.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.892
-Yeah, you do. You sound cute.
What a year you're having, pal.

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:28.695
I want to talk about --
dude, you have the --

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.263
you're on the biggest show
in the world, "Game of Thrones."

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:34.367
You're -- You're about to be...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.435
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.171
...in the biggest movie,
"Dark Phoenix."

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.608
And on top of it all, the best
news -- you just got married.

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:42.975
-I did.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:44.643
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:45.978
I mean, yes!
-Yes!

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:47.113
-You did it!
-Yes!

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.315
-Yes!
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.783
-You did it!
-I did it!

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:52.084
-You did it!

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:55.055
You showed 2019 what's up!
-I did.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.156
-You're like,
"2018, hold my beer."

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:58.224
You know what I'm saying?
-"Hold my beer."

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.592
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:02.595
-You married Joe Jonas,
who we love, and...

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:05.364
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:07.499
Look at this guy. Oh, my God.
That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:07.499 --> 00:01:08.834
Look at this couple.
-Ooh-whee!

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.804
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Fashion plates right there.

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.307
I saw you at the Met Gala.
-Yes, recently.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.008
-I -- Yeah, it was really fun,
though.

00:01:16.008 --> 00:01:17.577
It was like --
The theme was camp.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.378
-The theme was camp.
-Yes.

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:20.513
And so --
-So...

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.581
- Everyone's very campy.
-Everyone was very camp.

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:23.750
-Yes.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.718
And did you have fun?
-I had a great time.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:28.087
I didn't quite know
what camp meant.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:31.023
But I figured sequins
and colors would do.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:32.492
-Sure.
-Sure. Why not?

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.226
And matching --
isn't that quite camp?

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:35.260
-Yeah, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.662
It totally is camp, yeah.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:38.264
-I had glitter in my hair
that I found --

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:39.666
I keep finding
in my belly button.

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:40.867
[ Laughter ]
-That -- See, that's --

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.001
That's when you know
you had a fun night...

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.369
-Yeah.
-When you find glitter

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.370
in your belly button.
-I had a really good night.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.704
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.704 --> 00:01:47.507
-The best part is, it's
a cardboard cutout of Joe Jonas.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:48.675
You didn't even come with him.
You just --

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:49.709
-No, I didn't.
-You just --

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.177
You're just -- You're holding...

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.311
-I'm not actually married to
him.

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:53.679
[ Laughter ]
-You're not even really married.

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:54.814
Sure, it's perfect.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:55.915
-No, I just took
his cardboard cutout

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:58.785
to the little white chapel
and married him.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.219
-I have actually someone that --

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:02.088
a fan of yours send
in a video question.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:03.022
-Oh, you did?
-I did.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.256
Would you like to take one?

00:02:04.256 --> 00:02:05.958
-I would love to.
-This is a question from a fan.

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:07.626
I think his name is Joe.

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:08.694
Joe, what's your question?
-Oh.

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:11.397
-Oh, my God.
Hi, Sophie Turner.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.500
I'm Joe Jonas.
I'm a huge fan.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.335
I --
I honestly have a crush on you.

00:02:16.335 --> 00:02:18.404
But I have got a big question
for you.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.106
Um, I-I watch a lot
of "Game of Thrones."

00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:23.610
And I was wondering --

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:26.846
you're definitely responsible
for that coffee cup, right?

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:29.015
[ Audience ohs ]

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:31.384
-Yes!

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:32.685
It was you!

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:35.154
-It's w-- Okay.

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:36.689
-Lookit. Here's the scene.
-Let's clear this up.

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:37.857
[ Laughter ]
-Look, here's the scene.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.093
Here's the scene right here.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.294
Look at that.
And this is the scene.

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:43.262
And what is that right there?

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:45.964
[ Laughter ]
That is a Starbucks coffee cup.

00:02:45.964 --> 00:02:47.400
And you know what's funny

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.534
is that I saw a picture of
you...

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:51.270
-Mnh. Mnh.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.505
-...holding a coffee cup!
-No!

00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:54.874
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:56.676
[ Low notes play ]

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.844
-'Twas you!

00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:01.114
-All right, Detective Pikachu.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:04.483
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.483 --> 00:03:06.485
This -- Okay, let me --

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:08.320
for all of you guys that watch
"Game of Thrones"...

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:10.356
-Yeah.
-And this is a spoiler

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:13.926
for a couple of episodes ago.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:16.629
This girl dies --
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.698
In an episode --
one of the episodes.

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:24.270
And this is the scene
from the episode after she dies.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.540
So, why am I holding this
coffee cup?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.708
[ Audience ohhs ]
That's in a different scene.

00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:34.580
And, also...
we all have the same cups

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.350
for all of our water and tea
and everything.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.184
So I'm gonna just go with --

00:03:39.184 --> 00:03:41.553
I mean, look who it's placed
in front of.

00:03:41.553 --> 00:03:43.289
[ Laughter ]
-Whoa!

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:44.723
[ Audience ohs ]
Wow. Emilia --

00:03:44.723 --> 00:03:46.025
-Emilia Clarke.

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:47.993
-[ Laughing ] Oh, my. Really?
-She's the culprit.

00:03:47.993 --> 00:03:50.463
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my God!

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:52.365
Did --
-You're a terrible detective.

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:53.866
-Well, I got that out of you,
didn't I?

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:55.034
-Well, you did.
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.269
-Did you --
Did everyone text each other?

00:03:57.269 --> 00:03:58.637
All the actors on
"Game of Thrones" be like,

00:03:58.637 --> 00:04:00.205
"Dude,
did you guys see that cup?"

00:04:00.205 --> 00:04:02.909
-[ Chuckles ] Well, yeah, no.
There was just, like, one text.

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.911
And it was from Nikolaj,
who plays...

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.046
-Yeah.
-...Jaime Lannister.

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:08.414
And he just wrote,
"Great episode.

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:12.351
Is that a coffee cup?"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.351 --> 00:04:13.819
-I know we can't talk about
what -- what --

00:04:13.819 --> 00:04:14.954
what's gonna happen.

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:16.355
There's only
a couple episodes left.

00:04:16.355 --> 00:04:17.456
-No, we can.

00:04:17.456 --> 00:04:20.560
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.461
No, no, we -- No, we can't.

00:04:22.461 --> 00:04:23.762
No, that wasn't -- nope.

00:04:23.762 --> 00:04:26.099
-God, why do you guys --
you guys all come on the show.

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:27.499
And you're such good actors.

00:04:27.499 --> 00:04:28.968
Like, did you see
what we did with Maisie...

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:30.536
- Maisie.
-...Maisie Williams?

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:31.804
-Her hands were shaking.
-Dude, she -- her --

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.606
-She had tears in her eyes.
-Her acting was so good.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:35.575
I hated doing that bit.
-Yeah, you --

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:36.876
-I felt so bad.
I felt bad for her.

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:37.977
-Yeah, 'cause she looks like
a tiny little girl,

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:38.944
and you were just...

00:04:38.944 --> 00:04:40.046
-And she was just, like,
crumbling.

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:41.213
She thought she did
a fake spoiler.

00:04:41.213 --> 00:04:43.082
It was an April Fool's joke
that we did.

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:44.650
And I don't even like --
I don't even do those jokes.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:45.951
I don't like getting tricked.

00:04:45.951 --> 00:04:46.986
No one --
please don't trick me.

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:48.454
I don't like tricking people.

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:49.521
I don't like it.

00:04:49.521 --> 00:04:50.756
But then you almost
did something.

00:04:50.756 --> 00:04:51.991
But then you didn't do it.

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.493
But then,
can you tell us -- do you die?

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:54.861
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.861 --> 00:04:56.795
Come on. No, we don't know,
but, look -- here --

00:04:56.795 --> 00:04:58.631
Look, on --
This is a pain scale.

00:04:58.631 --> 00:04:59.932
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.667
A pain measurement scale
from a doctor's office.

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:03.769
Now, from -- from zero to 10,

00:05:03.769 --> 00:05:06.906
how much pain will we feel
at the end of "Game of Thrones"?

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.708
-Ohh.
-Not you personally.

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:10.776
-The audience?
-The audience, yeah.

00:05:10.776 --> 00:05:12.144
-Okay, all right.
You're gonna...

00:05:12.144 --> 00:05:15.281
-Hm.
I mean, it's probably gonna be

00:05:15.281 --> 00:05:17.816
around...
-No pain?

00:05:17.816 --> 00:05:20.686
-[ Gasps ] There!
-[ Laughing ] Oh, my gosh!

00:05:20.686 --> 00:05:22.154
You're --
-It will be.

00:05:22.154 --> 00:05:23.288
-[ British accent ] There!
-There!

00:05:23.288 --> 00:05:25.024
Did I sound very English there?

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:26.292
-[ Normal voice ]
No, it was great.

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:27.493
-There.
-There!

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:30.196
-There -- The thespians.
The English thespians.

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:32.031
-Why be here
when I can be there?

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:34.233
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:36.068
Can we talk about
"Dark Phoenix" now?

00:05:36.068 --> 00:05:37.069
-Oh, yeah, sure.

00:05:37.069 --> 00:05:38.604
-This is a giant, giant movie.

00:05:38.604 --> 00:05:40.139
I don't even know if people
understand how much work

00:05:40.139 --> 00:05:42.241
goes into these superhero films.

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:45.811
-It's a lot of work.
-It is a lot of --

00:05:45.811 --> 00:05:47.914
This costume is just one thing.

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:50.482
But, also, you're doing
a lot of flying.

00:05:50.482 --> 00:05:51.951
-Yeah, a lot of flying.
-Which means --

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.519
and I'm saying --
spoiler alert --

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:54.953
she really can't fly
in real life.

00:05:54.953 --> 00:05:57.489
Sorry, guys.
I know. Spoiler alert.

00:05:57.489 --> 00:06:00.359
But there's trickery --
there's trickery involved.

00:06:00.359 --> 00:06:01.460
-There is.
[ Both chuckle ]

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.794
-It's not really called that.

00:06:02.794 --> 00:06:05.864
But you're on wires, right,
when you're levitating?

00:06:05.864 --> 00:06:09.701
-Actually, originally,
I wasn't on wires.

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:12.204
I was on this thing that we call
the parallelogram.

00:06:12.204 --> 00:06:17.276
And it was basically like
there were weights on one end,

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:20.279
and then this kind of bike seat
on the other.

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:23.616
And so I would have to kind of
prop myself up on the bike seat

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:26.085
like that and dangle my legs.

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:29.188
And then they would lift me up
into the air by my crotch,

00:06:29.188 --> 00:06:31.691
which was just wonderful.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.691 --> 00:06:36.095
But on top of that,
I was wearing -- I was --

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:37.329
So, for all
of the flying scenes,

00:06:37.329 --> 00:06:40.600
I'm wearing, like,
this purple leather jacket

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.835
with this huge collar
that comes up like this.

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:44.637
-Yeah.
-And all the hair is CGI'd,

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:47.072
so I have to wear a bald cap.

00:06:47.072 --> 00:06:49.175
[ Laughter ]
And so...

00:06:49.175 --> 00:06:50.610
I look like Megamind...

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:51.676
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.676 --> 00:06:53.579
...with bad crotch pains.

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:55.681
[ Laughter ]
-"Bad Crotch Pains" --

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:58.183
I'm happy they didn't go
with that title for the movie.

00:06:58.183 --> 00:06:59.652
[ Laughter ]
-There I am.

00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:01.453
-"Dark Phoenix" is much better.
That's you levitating?

00:07:01.453 --> 00:07:04.056
-Don't I look so dangerous?
[ Laughter ]

00:07:04.056 --> 00:07:06.525
-I want to show a clip.

00:07:06.525 --> 00:07:09.061
Here is Sophie Turner
in "Dark Phoenix."

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:12.532
Hey, before we show this clip,
any spoilers?

00:07:12.532 --> 00:07:14.333
-Um...

00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:16.268
everyone -- everyone dies.

00:07:16.268 --> 00:07:17.970
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.706
-Don't go there.
-Don't go there.

00:07:20.706 --> 00:07:25.945
-Don't go there. Go over there.
-Yeah! Here, here.

00:07:25.945 --> 00:07:28.680
-"Dark Phoenix," take a look.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:32.952
-Look, I know who you are.

00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:35.221
I don't want to fight.
-No, you don't.

00:07:35.221 --> 00:07:37.557
[ Whirring ]

00:07:40.859 --> 00:07:43.930
-Stop that.
I said stop that right now.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:48.601
-It's not me.
-It's me.

00:07:48.601 --> 00:07:50.202
-Jean.

00:07:50.202 --> 00:07:52.605
♪♪

00:07:52.605 --> 00:07:53.839
Jean!

00:07:53.839 --> 00:07:56.208
♪♪

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:57.610
-Get down!

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:02.248
♪♪

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:07.185
♪♪

00:08:07.185 --> 00:08:10.155
-Whoa!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:10.155 --> 00:08:11.524
Sophie Turner, everybody!
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

